000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    TZEROWEIGH.
000500 AUTHOR.
000600      KURT MOVSESIAN.
000800
000900******************************************************
001000*                                                    *
001100*   T Z E R O B U F F                                *
001200*                                                    *
001300*   THIS PROGRAM WILL CHECK ALL FREIGHT REFERBACKS   *
001400*   AND ZERO OUT THE TWO WEIGHT FIELDS.              *
001600******************************************************
      *
      *C  06/07/1996   CA YODER
      *C    RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP CENTURY CHANGES.

002300
002400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002500 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002600 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002700 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT DFREIGHT-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2401
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                     WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
003000
003100 DATA DIVISION.
003200 FILE SECTION.
       FD  DFREIGHT-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DFREIGHT-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS2401.
003400
003500 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".
003600
       01  ERROR-RECORD-CTR             PIC 9(8) COMP-4 VALUE ZEROS.
       01  ERR-SW                       PIC X  VALUE SPACES.
       01  UPDATE-SWITCH                PIC X  VALUE SPACES.

003700**************************************************************
003800**************************************************************
003900**                                                          **
004000**                DATABASE I/O BUFFER AREA                  **
004100**                                                          **
004200**************************************************************
004300**************************************************************
004400
       COPY DFREIGHT IN COPYLIB.
007100
       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.

       01  BASE   PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
007400
007500 COPY TBLOWUP IN COPYLIB.
007600
007700 COPY VIEWDUM IN COPYLIB.
007800
008400
008500 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
008600
008700
008800
       BEGIN-HERE.
           DISPLAY "UPDATE (U) OR DISPLAY ONLY (D) RECORDS?".
           ACCEPT UPDATE-SWITCH.
           OPEN I-O DFREIGHT-O

           DISPLAY "BEGIN READING DPOFREIGHT".
008900     PERFORM 06-MAIN  THRU  06-M-X.

009000     CLOSE DFREIGHT-O.

009100     GOBACK.
009300
009400*******************************************************
009500**                                                   **
009600**   BLOWUP  ROUTINE                                 **
009700**                                                   **
009800*******************************************************
009900
010000 2-BLOWUP.
010100     MOVE "TZEROWEIG"      TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
010400     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
010500         VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
010600             BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
010700
010800 06-MAIN.
010900     READ DFREIGHT-O FIRST RECORD INTO BUF-DPOFREIGHT
               AT END GO TO 06-M-X.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "READ FIRST DFREIHGT *6-MAIN" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE ZERO TO ERROR-RECORD-CTR.
011000     PERFORM 061-READ-FILE THRU 061-RF-X.

           DISPLAY "TOTAL NO. OF RCDS WITH NON-NUMERIC DATA = ".
           DISPLAY ERROR-RECORD-CTR.

011100
       06-M-X.
011300     EXIT.
011400
011500 061-READ-FILE.
           MOVE SPACES TO ERR-SW.
           IF FRT-REFER-PO  NOT = SPACES
              MOVE "Y" TO ERR-SW
              MOVE ZEROES TO FRT-CARRIER-WT FRT-OUR-WT
           IF ERR-SW = "Y"
               ADD 1 TO ERROR-RECORD-CTR
               IF UPDATE-SWITCH = "U"
               REWRITE DFREIGHT-REC-O FROM BUF-DPOFREIGHT
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "REWRITE DFREIGHT 61-RF" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

           READ DFREIGHT-O NEXT RECORD INTO BUF-DPOFREIGHT
               AT END GO TO 061-RF-X.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "READ NEXT DFREIGHT *61-RF" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

           GO TO 061-READ-FILE.

       061-RF-X.
           EXIT.
